~ start
Krab: ….

do GameState.krab_attack.emit

- Raise shield and hold ground => defend_1
- Roll to the side => evade_1
- Step in and parry => parry_1

~ defend_1
Player raises shield just in time.

do GameState.krab_attack.emit
[wait=0.1]
do GameState.request_attack.emit
[wait=0.3]
do GameState.krab_attack.emit
[wait=0.1]
do GameState.request_attack.emit
[wait=0.3]
do GameState.krab_attack.emit
[wait=0.1]
do GameState.request_attack.emit
[wait=0.3]
do GameState.krab_attack.emit
[wait=0.1]
do GameState.request_attack.emit
[wait=0.3]

- Keep guarding => defend_loop

~ defend_loop
The blows keep coming. Your arm burns.

do GameState.krab_attack.emit
[wait=0.1]
do GameState.request_attack.emit
[wait=0.3]

- Break away => evade_1
- Desperate shove => shove_attempt




~ parry_1
You meet steel with steel.

do GameState.player_attack_villager.emit
[wait=0.2]
do GameState.krab_hurt.emit

Crescent Enforcer (surprised): …

- Riposte to the torso => riposte_hit
- Go for the weapon hand => disarm_attempt

~ riposte_hit
Your blade slips past his guard.

do GameState.player_attack_villager.emit
[wait=0.2]
do GameState.krab_hurt.emit

do GameState.krab_attack.emit
[wait=0.1]

- Fall back => evade_1

~ evade_1
You roll aside as the blade slams down.

do GameState.request_attack.emit
[wait=0.2]

- Strike from behind => backstab_attempt

~ backstab_attempt
You strike — but the armor turns the blade.

do GameState.full_attack.emit
[wait=0.4]
do GameState.krab_hurt.emit

do GameState.krab_attack.emit
[wait=0.1]
do GameState.request_attack.emit

~ shove_attempt
You slam into him.

do GameState.player_attack_villager.emit
[wait=0.2]
do GameState.krab_hurt.emit

Krab stumbles.

- Finish with a strike => finishing_blow
- Kick him back => finishing_blow

~ disarm_attempt
You twist for the weapon—
[wait=0.2]
Too slow. You fail.
do GameState.request_attack.emit
[wait=0.3]
do GameState.player_die.emit

~ finishing_blow
You strike with everything you have.

do GameState.full_attack.emit
[wait=0.2]
do GameState.krab_hurt.emit
[wait=0.1]
do GameState.krab_hurt.emit
[wait=0.1]
do GameState.krab_hurt.emit
[wait=0.3]

do GameState.krab_death.emit

=> END








